---
title: "Dice dungeon"
note: "An adventure the dice tell. A hero from __characters/fantasy__ walks a dungeon room by room; every room may bring a foe (30%), and a fight is won four times in five. A lost fight fades out and the hero stands at the gate again; a relic (8% a room) ends the reel. So every seed is an adventure of its own length. CUT TO: lines steer it; the rooms, foes and relics come with the preset (@lib). Play it with Run (Instant) and let it end on its own."
tags: [loops, h3, reel, goto, fantasy, motion_context]
---
@h3 text 16:9
context: 22
style: live-action, dark fantasy adventure, torchlight and deep shadow, one continuous shot
$hero = __characters/fantasy__
MUSIC: a low, pulsing drum at a slow tempo under a quiet, sustained horn

@lib dungeon_rooms
  a long vaulted corridor lined with guttering torches
  a flooded crypt where the black water reaches the knees
  a hall of collapsed pillars choked with pale roots
  a narrow stone bridge over a bottomless chasm
  a chamber of empty iron cages swaying on chains
  a library of rotting books with a ladder that ends in the dark
@lib dungeon_foes
  a skeleton knight in rusted plate, dragging a notched sword
  a giant pale spider dropping from the ceiling on a thread
  a hulking troll swinging a club made from a tree trunk
  a swarm of shrieking bats pouring out of a crack in the wall
  a hooded cultist hurling green fire from both hands
@lib dungeon_relics
  a golden crown that hums with light
  a crystal skull with a flame burning inside it
  a sword set in a block of stone, glowing blue

SCENE the gate
$room = __dungeon_rooms__
SHOT 8s: push in, slow
$hero pushes open a massive iron gate and steps into $room, torch held high.
SFX: the gate grinding on its hinges; water dripping somewhere far off
END ON: the adventurer walks deeper into the dark

SCENE the rooms
$room = __dungeon_rooms__
$threat = {30% a foe}
$find = {8% the relic}
SHOT 8s: tracking, slow
$hero moves carefully through $room, torch raised, every shadow shifting at the edge of the light.
SFX: footsteps on wet stone; the torch crackling
END ON: the adventurer stops at the threshold of the next chamber
IF $find[the relic]: CUT TO: the relic
IF $threat[a foe]: CUT TO: the fight
CUT TO: the rooms

SCENE the fight
$foe = __dungeon_foes__
$outcome = {80% victory|defeat}
SHOT 8s: arc, fast
Out of the dark comes $foe. $hero draws a blade and they clash in the flickering torchlight.
IF $outcome is victory: With a last blow the adventurer drives it back into the dark and stands, breathing hard.
IF $outcome is defeat: The adventurer is thrown to the stone floor, and the torch rolls away, guttering.
SFX: steel on steel; a roar echoing off the vaults; the torch hissing
END ON: the torchlight steadies on the floor
IF $outcome is defeat: CUT TO: the fall
CUT TO: the rooms

SCENE the fall
SHOT 8s: pull out, slow
The torch dies on the floor beside $hero, the darkness closes in, and far above a bell begins to toll. Then the light swells again, and the adventurer stands once more before the iron gate, as if waking from a dream.
SFX: the torch hissing out; a slow, distant bell; a sharp breath
END ON: the adventurer stands before the iron gate again
CUT TO: the gate

SCENE the relic
$relic = __dungeon_relics__
SHOT 10s: push in, slow
In the last chamber, on a stone altar, lies $relic. $hero lifts it, and its light floods the chamber, driving every shadow back into the walls.
SFX: a rising choir of voices; stone cracking as the roots pull back
